<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="description" content="Native Tunes shop: tees, hoodies, mugs and more with art from our sleep and meditation music.">
<meta property="og:title" content="Native Tunes Shop">
<meta property="og:description" content="Wear the calm. Art from the music you fall asleep to.">
<meta property="og:image" content="https://nativetunesmedia.com/img/banner.jpg">
<meta property="og:url" content="https://nativetunesmedia.com/">
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#070b1f">
<title>Native Tunes Shop</title>
<meta name="claude:viewport-fit-sides" content="cover">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@600;700&family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,500;9..144,600&family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap">
<style>
/* Layout: night-sky home (A) with a banner hero; aurora-glass subpages (B); the shop catalog sits on a white panel so products read clearly. */
:root{
  --night:#070b1f; --night-2:#0b1230; --panel:#121a3d; --line:#22305e;
  --gold:#d4a75f; --gold-soft:#f0d9a8; --star:#b8cbe8; --mist:#9fb0d6; --ink:#dfe6f7;
  --teal:#7fe3d0; --violet:#7850c8;
  --paper:#ffffff; --paper-2:#f3f2ef; --paper-ink:#141428; --paper-mute:#5c6078; --paper-line:#e4e2dc;
  --font-brand:"Cinzel", "Trajan Pro", Georgia, serif;
  --font-display:"Fraunces", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  --font-body:"Poppins", "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif;
  color-scheme: dark;
}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;background:var(--night);-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}
body{margin:0}
[hidden]{display:none!important}
body{background:transparent;color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--font-body);font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;overflow-x:hidden}
img{max-width:100%}
#sky{position:fixed;inset:0;width:100vw;height:100vh;z-index:-1;pointer-events:none;display:block}
a{color:var(--gold-soft);text-decoration:none}
a:hover{color:#fff}
:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--gold);outline-offset:3px;border-radius:6px}
h1,h2,h3{text-wrap:balance;margin:0}
p{margin:0}
.wrap{max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding-left:max(16px,env(safe-area-inset-left,0px));padding-right:max(16px,env(safe-area-inset-right,0px))}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:48px;padding:0 26px;border-radius:999px;font:600 15px var(--font-body);cursor:pointer;border:1.5px solid transparent;transition:transform .2s,background .2s}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px)}
.btn-gold{background:var(--gold);color:var(--night-2)}
.btn-gold:hover{background:var(--gold-soft);color:var(--night-2)}
.btn-ghost{border-color:var(--star);color:var(--ink);background:transparent}
.btn-ghost:hover{color:#fff;border-color:#fff}
.eyebrow{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--star)}

/* header */
.site-head{position:sticky;top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);z-index:40;background:rgba(7,11,31,.82);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06)}
body::before{content:"";position:fixed;inset:0 0 auto;height:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);z-index:41;background:var(--night)}
.head-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding-block:14px}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;color:var(--gold-soft)}
.brand img{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%}
.brand span{font-family:var(--font-brand);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.2em;font-size:19px}
.nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.09);border-radius:999px;padding:5px}
.nav a,.nav button{padding:9px 16px;border-radius:999px;color:var(--ink);font:500 14px var(--font-body);background:none;border:0;cursor:pointer}
.nav a[aria-current="page"]{background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);color:#fff}
.cart-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;min-height:44px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:999px;border:0;background:var(--gold);color:var(--night-2);font:600 14px var(--font-body);cursor:pointer}
.head-row .nav{margin-left:auto}

/* pages */
.page{display:none}
.page.on{display:block}

/* HOME (A) */
/* banner always shown whole at its true 8:3 shape, so nothing is cropped on any screen */
.hero{position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.hero-img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:8/3;mix-blend-mode:lighten}
.hero-inner{position:relative;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:18px;padding-block:22px 8px;width:100%}
.hero-inner p{font-size:19px;color:var(--star);max-width:520px}
.hero-cta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px}
.section{padding-block:56px 32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:28px}
.section-head{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:16px;position:relative}
.loop-card{position:relative;margin:0 auto 26px;width:230px;pointer-events:none;aspect-ratio:9/16;border-radius:22px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid rgba(240,217,168,.45);box-shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.55),0 0 40px rgba(127,232,224,.18);background:#0a1028;display:block}
.loop-card video{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}
@media (max-width:600px){.loop-card{width:200px;margin-bottom:18px}}
.home h2{font-family:var(--font-brand);font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,38px);color:var(--gold-soft)}
.new-tag{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font:700 15px var(--font-body);letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--night-2);background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f0d9a8,#d4a75f);padding:6px 14px;border-radius:999px;align-self:flex-start;margin-bottom:10px;box-shadow:0 0 24px rgba(240,217,168,.35)}
.h2-link{color:inherit}
.h2-link:hover{color:#fff}
.see-all{font-size:17px;min-height:54px;padding:0 30px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(212,167,95,.35)}
.see-all-row{display:flex;justify-content:center;margin-top:4px}
.feat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:22px;perspective:1200px}
.tilt{background:linear-gradient(160deg,rgba(20,32,70,.92),rgba(11,18,48,.92));border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:22px;padding:14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;color:var(--ink);transform-style:preserve-3d;transition:transform .25s ease,box-shadow .25s;box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.45);cursor:pointer;text-align:left;font:inherit;position:relative}
.tilt .art{background:#efeeeb;border-radius:14px;aspect-ratio:1;max-width:100%;overflow:hidden;display:block;transform:translateZ(30px)}
.tilt .art img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}
.tilt .flag{position:absolute;top:22px;left:22px;z-index:2;background:var(--gold);color:var(--night-2);font:700 11px var(--font-body);letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;transform:translateZ(40px)}
.tilt b{color:var(--gold-soft);font-weight:600}
.tilt small{color:var(--mist);font-size:14px}
.listen{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:32px;align-items:center}
.video-card{flex:1 1 420px;min-width:0;position:relative;aspect-ratio:16/9;max-width:100%;border-radius:22px;overflow:hidden;background:#0a1028;display:block}
.video-card img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;opacity:.85;transition:transform .6s}
.video-card:hover img{transform:scale(1.04)}
.play{position:absolute;inset:0;margin:auto;width:78px;height:78px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(212,167,95,.94);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.listen-copy{flex:1 1 340px;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px}
.listen-copy p{color:var(--star);font-size:17px}
.listen-copy .help-line{font-size:15px;color:#f0d9a8;margin-top:-4px}
.video-card iframe{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;border:0}

/* SUBPAGES (B) */
.aurora{background:radial-gradient(900px 500px at 88% 0%,rgba(64,180,170,.20),transparent 70%),radial-gradient(800px 600px at 6% 30%,rgba(120,80,200,.20),transparent 70%),var(--night)}
.side-sw{position:absolute;top:14px;right:14px;display:flex;gap:4px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.92);border:1px solid var(--paper-line);border-radius:999px;padding:4px;z-index:3}
.side-sw button{min-height:36px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:999px;border:0;background:none;color:var(--paper-ink);font:600 13px var(--font-body);cursor:pointer}
.side-sw button[aria-pressed="true"]{background:var(--paper-ink);color:var(--paper)}
.acct-btn{font-weight:600!important;color:var(--gold-soft,#f0d9a8)!important;white-space:nowrap}
.acct-modal{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:80;background:rgba(5,7,18,.72);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:16px}
.acct-card{background:var(--paper);color:var(--paper-ink);border-radius:24px;width:min(460px,100%);max-height:100%;overflow:auto;padding:26px 24px;box-shadow:0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.5);overflow-x:hidden}
.acct-card form>*{min-width:0}
.acct-card .chk span{flex:1;min-width:0}
.acct-card h2{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:28px;margin:0 0 6px}
.acct-card p.sub{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--paper-mute);font-size:14px}
.acct-card form{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}
.acct-card label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--paper-mute);grid-column:span 2}
.acct-card label.half{grid-column:span 1}
.acct-card input{min-height:44px;border:1.5px solid var(--paper-line);border-radius:12px;padding:0 12px;font:15px var(--font-body);color:var(--paper-ink);background:var(--paper);text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0}
.acct-card .chk{flex-direction:row;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-size:13px}
.acct-card .chk input{min-height:auto;margin-top:2px}
.acct-card .row{grid-column:span 2;display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;margin-top:4px}
.acct-card .err{grid-column:span 2;color:#b3261e;font-size:14px;min-height:0;margin:0}
.acct-card .link{border:0;background:none;color:#5a3fb0;text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer;font:14px var(--font-body);padding:0}
.acct-x{float:right;width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid var(--paper-line);background:var(--paper);cursor:pointer;font-size:20px;color:var(--paper-ink)}
.acct-h3{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:20px;margin:22px 0 8px}
.acct-orders{display:grid;gap:10px}
.acct-order{border:1px solid var(--paper-line);border-radius:14px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px}
.acct-order ul{margin:6px 0;padding-left:18px}
.ao-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.ao-st{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--paper-2)}
.ao-shipped{background:#dcefdc;color:#1f5c2a}
.acct-offer{background:var(--paper-2);border-radius:14px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px}
.acct-offer .link{border:0;background:none;color:#5a3fb0;text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer;font:600 14px var(--font-body);padding:0}
.nebula-bg{position:relative;isolation:isolate;background:transparent}
.nebula-bg::before{content:"";position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:-1;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(7,11,31,.42),rgba(7,11,31,.6) 60%,rgba(7,11,31,.78)),url(img/nebula.jpg) center/cover no-repeat,var(--night);pointer-events:none}
.sub-hero{padding-block:56px 32px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:40px}
.sub-hero .copy{flex:1 1 440px;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px}
.sub-hero h1{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(38px,6vw,62px);line-height:1.05;color:#f4f2fb}
.sub-hero .lede{font-size:18px;color:#aab3cc;max-width:520px}
.spin-stage{flex:1 1 360px;min-width:0;height:420px;position:relative}
.hero-shot{flex:1 1 360px;min-width:0;max-width:460px;margin-inline:auto;border-radius:24px;overflow:hidden;background:#efeeeb;box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.45);display:block;cursor:pointer;border:0;padding:0}
.hero-shot img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}
.spin-stage canvas{width:100%!important;height:100%!important;cursor:grab}
.spin-hint{position:absolute;bottom:6px;left:0;right:0;text-align:center;font-size:13px;color:var(--mist)}
.prose{max-width:720px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;padding-block:8px 72px;color:#c9d1e6}
.prose h2{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:600;font-size:26px;color:#f4f2fb;margin-top:12px}
.prose .updated{font-size:13px;color:#8a93b0;margin-top:8px}
.prose ul{margin:0;padding-left:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.glass{background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);border-radius:22px}
.vid-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:20px;padding-bottom:72px}
.vid{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;padding:12px;color:var(--ink)}
.vid img{border-radius:14px;aspect-ratio:16/9;max-width:100%;object-fit:cover;width:100%}
.vid span{font-weight:500;font-size:15px;padding:0 4px 6px}

.vid .thumb{position:relative;display:block}
.vid .thumb em{position:absolute;right:8px;bottom:8px;background:rgba(5,8,25,.82);color:#fff;font:600 12px var(--font-body);font-style:normal;padding:3px 7px;border-radius:6px}
.list-h{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:600;font-size:26px;color:#f4f2fb;margin:8px 0 16px}
.list-h small{font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);opacity:.7;font-weight:500}
.list-head{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-top:40px}
.list-links{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}
.pl-thumb{position:relative;display:block;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#0a1028;margin-bottom:6px;box-shadow:6px -6px 0 -2px rgba(255,255,255,.18),12px -12px 0 -4px rgba(255,255,255,.08)}
.pl-thumb img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}
.pl-count{position:absolute;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;width:38%;background:rgba(5,8,25,.78);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:6px;color:#fff;font:600 14px var(--font-body)}
.pl-play{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:rgba(5,8,25,.6);color:#fff;font:600 15px var(--font-body);letter-spacing:.06em;opacity:0;transition:opacity .2s}
.pl:hover .pl-play,.pl:focus-visible .pl-play{opacity:1}
.pl-thumb.pillar .bg{position:absolute;inset:0;filter:blur(14px) brightness(.6);transform:scale(3)}
.pl-thumb.pillar .fg{position:relative;transform:translateX(-19%) scale(var(--z))}
.pl-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(230px,1fr));gap:16px}
.pl{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;padding:12px 12px 16px;color:var(--ink);transition:transform .2s,background .2s}
.pl:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);background:rgba(255,255,255,.09)}
.pl svg{color:var(--gold)}
.pl b{color:#f4f2fb;font-size:16px}
.pl small{opacity:.75}
.sound-btn{position:fixed;left:16px;bottom:16px;z-index:40;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);background:rgba(8,12,36,.72);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);color:var(--star);font:500 13px var(--font-body);cursor:pointer}
.sound-btn[hidden]{display:none}

/* SHOP: white catalog panel */
.shop-panel{background:var(--paper-2);color:var(--paper-ink);border-radius:32px 32px 0 0;padding-block:40px 80px}
.shop-tools{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;margin-bottom:24px}
.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}
.chip{min-height:44px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:999px;border:1.5px solid var(--paper-line);background:var(--paper);color:var(--paper-ink);font:500 14px var(--font-body);cursor:pointer}
.chip[aria-pressed="true"]{background:var(--paper-ink);color:var(--paper);border-color:var(--paper-ink)}
.colorswitch{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:14px;color:var(--paper-mute)}
.swatch{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid var(--paper-line);cursor:pointer;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.swatch[aria-pressed="true"]{border-color:var(--gold);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(212,167,95,.3)}
.swatch i{width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;display:block}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(230px,1fr));gap:20px}
.card{background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--paper-line);border-radius:22px;padding:16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;font:inherit;color:var(--paper-ink);transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s}
.card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 18px 40px rgba(20,20,40,.12)}
.card .tee{position:relative;aspect-ratio:1;max-width:100%;display:block;background:#efeeeb;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden}
.card .tee img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;transition:transform .5s}
.card:hover .tee img{transform:scale(1.04)}
.card .dots{display:flex;gap:6px}
.card .dots i{width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid #cfccc4;display:block}
.card b{font-size:16px;font-weight:600}
.card .meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;font-size:14px;color:var(--paper-mute)}
.card .meta strong{color:var(--paper-ink)}

/* MODAL */
.modal{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:60;background:rgba(5,7,18,.72);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:max(16px,env(safe-area-inset-top,0px)) max(16px,env(safe-area-inset-right,0px)) max(16px,env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)) max(16px,env(safe-area-inset-left,0px))}
.sheet{background:var(--paper);color:var(--paper-ink);border-radius:28px;width:min(1120px,100%);max-height:100%;overflow:auto;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap}
.viewer{flex:1 1 460px;min-width:0;position:relative;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 40%,#ffffff,#e9e8e4 75%);min-height:460px;border-radius:0 0 0 28px}
.viewer canvas{display:block;width:100%!important;height:100%!important;position:absolute;inset:0;cursor:grab;touch-action:none}
.viewer canvas:active{cursor:grabbing}
.viewer-tools{position:absolute;left:14px;right:14px;bottom:14px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;pointer-events:none}
.viewer-tools button{pointer-events:auto}
.tool{min-height:44px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--paper-line);background:rgba(255,255,255,.9);color:var(--paper-ink);font:500 13px var(--font-body);cursor:pointer}
.badge360{position:absolute;top:14px;left:14px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;background:var(--paper-ink);color:var(--paper);padding:6px 12px;border-radius:999px}
.zoom-layer{position:absolute;inset:0;background:var(--paper);overflow:hidden;cursor:zoom-out;border-radius:inherit}
.zoom-layer img{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;width:90%;max-width:none;transform-origin:center;transition:transform .08s}
.info{flex:1 1 360px;min-width:0;padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px}
.info-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px}
.info h2{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:600;font-size:32px}
.info .from{font-size:14px;color:var(--paper-mute)}
.price{font-size:26px;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.x{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid var(--paper-line);background:var(--paper);cursor:pointer;flex:none;color:var(--paper-ink);font-size:22px;line-height:1}
.opt{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.opt label,.opt .lbl{font-size:13px;color:var(--paper-mute);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase}
.pills{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}
.pill{min-height:44px;min-width:52px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:999px;border:1.5px solid var(--paper-line);background:var(--paper);color:var(--paper-ink);font:500 14px var(--font-body);cursor:pointer}
.pill[aria-pressed="true"]{background:var(--paper-ink);color:var(--paper);border-color:var(--paper-ink)}
.items{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(92px,1fr));gap:8px}
.item{border:1.5px solid var(--paper-line);border-radius:14px;background:var(--paper-2);padding:10px 6px;font:500 13px var(--font-body);cursor:pointer;color:var(--paper-ink);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:4px}
.item[aria-pressed="true"]{border-color:var(--paper-ink);background:var(--paper)}
.item small{color:var(--paper-mute);font-size:12px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.care{font-size:13px;color:var(--paper-mute);border-top:1px solid var(--paper-line);padding-top:14px}
.still{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:#efeeeb;border-radius:inherit;overflow:hidden;cursor:zoom-in}
.still img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;display:block}
.thumbs{position:absolute;left:14px;top:14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;z-index:2}
.thumbs button{width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:10px;border:2px solid transparent;padding:0;overflow:hidden;background:#efeeeb;cursor:pointer}
.thumbs button[aria-pressed="true"]{border-color:var(--paper-ink)}
.thumbs img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}
.sheet-bar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;flex-basis:100%;padding:12px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--paper-line)}
.back{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;min-height:44px;padding:0 16px 0 10px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--paper-line);background:var(--paper);color:var(--paper-ink);font:600 14px var(--font-body);cursor:pointer}
.back:hover{background:var(--paper-2)}
.share-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;min-height:44px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid var(--paper-line);background:var(--paper);color:var(--paper-ink);font:600 14px var(--font-body);cursor:pointer}
.share-btn:hover{background:var(--paper-2)}
.bar-right{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}
/* share sheet */
.share{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:90;background:rgba(5,7,18,.6);display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:center;padding:16px}
@media (min-width:701px){.share{align-items:center}}
.share-card{background:var(--paper);color:var(--paper-ink);border-radius:24px;width:min(520px,100%);padding:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;max-height:100%;overflow:auto}
.share-card h3{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:600;font-size:22px}
.share-prev{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
.share-prev img{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:12px;object-fit:cover;background:#efeeeb}
.share-prev small{color:var(--paper-mute)}
.copy-row{display:flex;gap:8px}
.copy-row input{flex:1;min-width:0;min-height:46px;border:1.5px solid var(--paper-line);border-radius:12px;padding:0 12px;font:14px var(--font-body);color:var(--paper-ink);background:var(--paper-2)}
.copy-row button{min-height:46px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:12px;border:0;background:var(--paper-ink);color:var(--paper);font:600 14px var(--font-body);cursor:pointer}
.share-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(92px,1fr));gap:10px}
.share-grid a,.share-grid button{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:12px 4px;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid var(--paper-line);background:var(--paper);color:var(--paper-ink);font:500 12.5px var(--font-body);cursor:pointer;text-align:center}
.share-grid a:hover,.share-grid button:hover{background:var(--paper-2);color:var(--paper-ink)}
.share-grid i{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font:700 15px var(--font-body);font-style:normal}
.share-note{font-size:13px;color:var(--paper-mute)}

/* announcement, signup, promo, size guide */
.announce{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#d4a75f,#f0d9a8,#d4a75f);color:#0b1230;text-align:center;font:600 13.5px var(--font-body);padding:8px 16px;letter-spacing:.02em}
.announce a{color:#0b1230;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
.join{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:28px;border-radius:24px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(212,167,95,.16),rgba(120,80,200,.16));border:1px solid rgba(240,217,168,.35)}
.join-copy{flex:1 1 320px;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.join-copy p{color:var(--star)}
.join form{flex:1 1 340px;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}
.join input{flex:1 1 200px;min-width:0;min-height:50px;border-radius:999px;border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25);background:rgba(5,8,25,.55);color:#fff;padding:0 20px;font:15px var(--font-body)}
.join input::placeholder{color:#8f9cc2}
.join-msg{flex-basis:100%;font-size:15px;color:var(--gold-soft);min-height:1em}
.join-msg b{font-size:20px;letter-spacing:.08em;background:#0b1230;border:1px dashed var(--gold);padding:4px 12px;border-radius:10px;margin:0 4px}
.sizeguide{border:1px solid var(--paper-line);border-radius:14px;padding:10px 14px;font-size:14px}
.sizeguide summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;min-height:28px;display:flex;align-items:center}
.sizeguide table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:8px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.sizeguide th,.sizeguide td{padding:6px 4px;text-align:center;border-bottom:1px solid var(--paper-line)}
.sizeguide th:first-child,.sizeguide td:first-child{text-align:left}
.bundle-hint{font-size:14px;background:#fbf4e6;border:1px solid #efdcb6;color:#5b4515;border-radius:12px;padding:10px 12px}
.listen-mini{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;border:1px solid var(--paper-line);border-radius:14px;padding:8px;color:var(--paper-ink)}
.listen-mini:hover{background:var(--paper-2);color:var(--paper-ink)}
.listen-mini img{width:96px;aspect-ratio:16/9;object-fit:cover;border-radius:8px;flex:none}
.listen-mini small{display:block;color:var(--paper-mute);font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em}
.listen-mini span{font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.35;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden}
.ship-prog{font-size:14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
.ship-prog .bar{height:8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--paper-2);overflow:hidden}
.ship-prog .bar i{display:block;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#d4a75f,#2e9d62);border-radius:999px}
.promo label{font-size:13px;color:var(--paper-mute);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase}
.promo-row{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:6px}
.promo-row input{flex:1;min-width:0;min-height:46px;border:1.5px solid var(--paper-line);border-radius:12px;padding:0 12px;font:15px var(--font-body);text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--paper-ink);background:var(--paper)}
.promo-row button{min-height:46px;padding:0 18px;border-radius:12px;border:0;background:var(--paper-ink);color:var(--paper);font:600 14px var(--font-body);cursor:pointer}
.promo-ok{color:#1d7a46;font-weight:600}
.promo-ok button{border:0;background:none;color:var(--paper-mute);text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer;font:13px var(--font-body);margin-left:6px}
.sum-lines{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;font-size:14.5px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.sum-lines div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between}
.sum-lines .save{color:#1d7a46}

/* cart drawer */
.drawer{position:fixed;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;width:min(420px,100%);z-index:70;background:var(--paper);color:var(--paper-ink);box-shadow:-20px 0 60px rgba(0,0,0,.35);display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:calc(24px + env(safe-area-inset-top,0px)) max(24px,env(safe-area-inset-right,0px)) calc(24px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)) 24px;gap:16px}
.drawer h2{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:600;font-size:28px}
.lines{flex:1;overflow:auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
.line{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid var(--paper-line);padding-bottom:12px}
.line img{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:10px;object-fit:cover;background:var(--paper-ink)}
.line div{flex:1;min-width:0;font-size:14px}
.line button{border:0;background:none;color:var(--paper-mute);cursor:pointer;font:500 13px var(--font-body);min-height:44px}
.total{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-weight:600;font-size:18px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.note{font-size:13px;color:var(--paper-mute)}

/* footer */
.foot{border-top:1px solid #1a2550;background:var(--night)}
.foot .wrap{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;padding-block:36px;font-size:14px;color:var(--mist)}
.foot nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px}
.foot .muted{color:#6f7da6}
.toast{position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:calc(24px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px));transform:translateX(-50%);z-index:80;background:var(--paper-ink);color:var(--paper);padding:12px 20px;border-radius:999px;font-size:14px}

@media (max-width:700px){
  .viewer{border-radius:0;min-height:0;aspect-ratio:1;flex-basis:100%}
  .modal{padding:0}
  .sheet{border-radius:0;height:100%;max-height:none;align-content:flex-start}
  .info{padding:18px 16px 32px}
  .sheet-bar{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:3;background:var(--paper);padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--paper-line);flex-basis:100%}
  .thumbs{left:10px;top:10px}.thumbs button{width:44px;height:44px}
  .hero-inner{padding-block:16px 4px}
  .hero-inner p{font-size:17px}
  .hero-cta .btn{flex:1 1 auto}
  .sound-btn{left:auto;right:12px;bottom:12px;padding:8px 12px}
  .spin-stage{height:auto}
  .head-row{padding-block:10px;gap:8px}
  .head-row .nav{order:3;flex-basis:100%;margin-left:0}
  .cart-btn{min-height:40px;padding:0 14px}
  .brand img{width:36px;height:36px}.brand span{font-size:16px}
  .nav{flex-wrap:nowrap;overflow-x:auto;max-width:100%;scrollbar-width:none;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch}
  .nav::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
  .nav a,.nav button{padding:8px 13px;white-space:nowrap;flex:none}
  .grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}
  .card{padding:10px;border-radius:16px;gap:8px}.card b{font-size:14.5px}
  .card .meta span{display:none}
  .feat-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}
  .tilt{padding:10px;border-radius:16px}.tilt small{display:none}.tilt b{font-size:14.5px}
  .tilt .flag{top:16px;left:16px}
  .section-head .btn{display:none}
  .shop-panel{border-radius:24px 24px 0 0;padding-top:24px}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{transition:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="announce">Free US shipping on orders $75+ · <b>Limited time: extra 10% off orders $100+</b> · Tee + mug bundle saves $5 · <a href="#join">Join the list for 10% off your first order</a></div>
<header class="site-head">
  <div class="wrap head-row">
    <a class="brand" href="#home"><img src="img/logo-badge.jpg" alt=""><span>NATIVE TUNES</span></a>
    <nav class="nav" aria-label="Main">
      <a href="#home" data-nav="home">Home</a>
      <button type="button" id="acctBtn" class="acct-btn">Log in</button>
      <a href="#shop" data-nav="shop">Shop</a>
      <a href="#listen" data-nav="listen">Listen</a>
      <a href="#about" data-nav="about">About</a>
      <a href="#contact" data-nav="contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
    <button type="button" class="cart-btn" id="cartBtn" aria-label="Open cart"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 7h12l-1.2 12.2a2 2 0 01-2 1.8H9.2a2 2 0 01-2-1.8L6 7zm3 0V6a3 3 0 016 0v1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span>Cart (<span id="cartCount">0</span>)</span></button>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
<!-- HOME (A) -->
<section class="page home" id="page-home">
  <div class="hero">
    <img class="hero-img" src="img/banner.jpg" alt="Native Tunes · Sleep, meditation, relaxing sounds" width="2400" height="900">
    <div class="wrap hero-inner">
      <p>Wear the calm. Art from the music you fall asleep to.</p>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.youtube.com/@NativeTunes/videos">Listen on YouTube</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap section">
    <div class="loop-card" aria-hidden="true"><video id="fluteLoop" src="img/flute-short.mp4" poster="img/flute-short.jpg" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="auto" disablepictureinpicture disableremoteplayback></video></div>
    <div class="section-head">
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column">
        <span class="new-tag">✦ New Releases!</span>
        <h2><a class="h2-link" href="#shop">Shop Featured Designs</a></h2>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn-gold" href="#shop">Shop now →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="feat-grid" id="featGrid"></div>
    <div class="see-all-row"><a class="btn btn-gold see-all" href="#shop">See all designs →</a></div>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap section" id="join">
    <div class="join">
      <div class="join-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">The Native Tunes list</span>
        <h2>Get 10% off your first order</h2>
        <p>New designs, new sleep music, and members-only drops. No spam, unsubscribe anytime.</p>
      </div>
      <form id="joinForm" novalidate>
        <input type="email" id="joinEmail" placeholder="Your email address" autocomplete="email" aria-label="Email address" required>
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-gold">Get my code</button>
        <p class="join-msg" id="joinMsg" aria-live="polite"></p>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap section">
    <div class="listen">
      <a class="video-card" id="homeVideo" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rjovJk6Hsug" aria-label="Play Fall Asleep Fast: 432 Hz singing bowls and gentle rain">
        <img src="https://i.ytimg.com/vi/rjovJk6Hsug/maxresdefault.jpg" alt="Fall Asleep Fast video thumbnail" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='img/video.jpg'">
        <span class="play"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z" fill="#0b1230"/></svg></span>
      </a>
      <div class="listen-copy">
        <h2>Fall asleep with us</h2>
        <p>Our newest video: 432 Hz singing bowls and gentle rain, eight hours on a black screen for deep sleep.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.youtube.com/@NativeTunes/videos" style="align-self:flex-start">Subscribe on YouTube</a>
        <p class="help-line">Please help us by liking, subscribing, and commenting on our channel. Thank you!</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="height:56px"></div>
</section>

<!-- SHOP (B + white catalog) -->
<section class="page aurora nebula-bg" id="page-shop">
  <div class="wrap sub-hero">
    <div class="copy">
      <span class="eyebrow">Shop · printed on demand</span>
      <h1>Music to sleep by.<br>Art to wear.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Every design comes from a Native Tunes video. Tap any design to see it in every color, zoom in on the art, and see every item it comes on.</p>
    </div>
    <button type="button" class="hero-shot" id="heroShot" aria-label="Let the Music Heal · Feathers tee, view details"><img src="img/m/g7-tee-black.webp" alt="Let the Music Heal · Feathers t-shirt in black" width="900" height="900"></button>
  </div>
  <div class="shop-panel">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="shop-tools">
        <div class="chips" role="group" aria-label="Filter designs" id="chips"></div>
        <div class="colorswitch" role="group" aria-label="Shirt color">
          <span>Shirt color</span>
          <button type="button" class="swatch" data-shirt="Black" aria-pressed="true" aria-label="Black shirts" title="Black"><i style="background:#18181b"></i></button>
          <button type="button" class="swatch" data-shirt="White" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="White shirts" title="White"><i style="background:#f4f4f2;border:1px solid #d9d9d4"></i></button>
          <button type="button" class="swatch" data-shirt="Heather Gray" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Heather gray shirts" title="Heather Gray"><i style="background:#b0b0ad"></i></button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid" id="shopGrid"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- LISTEN (B) -->
<section class="page aurora nebula-bg" id="page-listen">
  <div class="wrap sub-hero"><div class="copy">
    <span class="eyebrow">Sleep · Meditation · 432 Hz</span>
    <h1>Listen tonight</h1>
    <p class="lede">Native flute, rain, waterfalls, ocean waves and singing bowls, made to be calm enough to sleep through. New videos premiere on YouTube.</p>
  </div></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="list-h">Playlists</h2>
    <div class="pl-grid" id="plGrid"></div>
    <div class="list-head"><h2 class="list-h">All videos <small id="vidCount"></small></h2>
      <div class="list-links"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.youtube.com/@NativeTunes/shorts">Watch our Shorts</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.youtube.com/@NativeTunes/playlists">All playlists on YouTube</a></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap vid-grid" id="vidGrid"></div>
</section>

<!-- ABOUT (B) -->
<section class="page aurora nebula-bg" id="page-about">
  <div class="wrap sub-hero"><div class="copy">
    <span class="eyebrow">Our story</span>
    <h1>Calm, made by hand and by ear</h1>
  </div></div>
  <div class="wrap"><div class="prose">
    <p>Native Tunes makes long-form sleep and meditation music: Native-style flute over rain, rivers, waterfalls and ocean waves, with Tibetan-style singing bowls tuned to 432 Hz and 528 Hz. Every video pairs the sound with a slow, peaceful scene so it stays easy to drift off to.</p>
    <p>This shop turns the art from those videos into things you can keep close: soft tees, hoodies, mugs and prints. Each piece is printed when you order it, so nothing sits in a warehouse and nothing goes to waste.</p>
    <p>Our designs are inspired by the music and by nature. Native Tunes products are not made by Native American artists and are not presented as Native American made.</p>
  </div></div>
</section>

<!-- LEGAL (B) -->
<section class="page aurora nebula-bg" id="page-contact">
  <div class="wrap sub-hero"><div class="copy"><span class="eyebrow">We're here to help</span><h1>Contact</h1>
    <p class="lede">Questions about an order, sizing or our music? Email us and we'll reply within 1 to 2 business days.</p>
    <p><a class="btn btn-gold" href="mailto:customerservice@nativetunesmedia.com">customerservice@nativetunesmedia.com</a></p>
  </div></div>
</section>

<section class="page aurora" id="page-shipping">
  <div class="wrap sub-hero"><div class="copy"><span class="eyebrow">Help</span><h1>Shipping &amp; returns</h1></div></div>
  <div class="wrap"><div class="prose">
    <h2>Made to order</h2>
    <p>Every item is printed after you order it by our print partner. Production usually takes 2 to 5 business days, then shipping takes about 3 to 7 business days in the US. You'll get tracking by email once your order ships.</p>
    <h2>Damaged or misprinted items</h2>
    <p>If your item arrives damaged, defective or with a printing error, email us at <a href="mailto:customerservice@nativetunesmedia.com">customerservice@nativetunesmedia.com</a> with a photo within 30 days of delivery and we'll replace it or refund you at no cost.</p>
    <h2>Returns</h2>
    <p>Because each item is made just for you, we can't accept returns or exchanges for wrong size or change of mind. Please check the size chart before ordering.</p>
    <h2>Care</h2>
    <p>Wash inside out in cold water and tumble dry low, or hang dry. Don't iron directly on the print.</p>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: October 26, 2026</p>
  </div></div>
</section>
<section class="page aurora" id="page-terms">
  <div class="wrap sub-hero"><div class="copy"><span class="eyebrow">Legal</span><h1>Terms of sale</h1></div></div>
  <div class="wrap"><div class="prose">
    <p>By placing an order on www.nativetunesmedia.com you agree to these terms.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Prices are in US dollars. Shipping and any sales tax are shown at checkout before you pay.</li>
      <li>Payments are processed securely by Stripe. We never see or store your full card number.</li>
      <li>Orders are produced and shipped by our print-on-demand partner. Delivery times are estimates.</li>
      <li>Colors on screen can look slightly different from the printed product.</li>
      <li>All Native Tunes designs, artwork, logos and music are owned by Parraga International LLC DBA Native Tunes and Native Tunes Media, and may not be copied or resold.</li>
      <li>We may cancel an order and refund you in full if an item can't be produced.</li>
      <li>Returns, exchanges and damaged items are covered on our <a href="#shipping">Shipping &amp; returns</a> page.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: October 26, 2026</p>
  </div></div>
</section>
<section class="page aurora" id="page-privacy">
  <div class="wrap sub-hero"><div class="copy"><span class="eyebrow">Legal</span><h1>Privacy</h1></div></div>
  <div class="wrap"><div class="prose">
    <p>We collect only what we need to fulfill your order: your name, email, shipping address and order details.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Payment details go directly to Stripe and are handled under Stripe's privacy policy.</li>
      <li>We use your email to send order updates. We'll only send news or offers if you sign up for them.</li>
      <li>If you create an account, we store your name, email, phone and shipping address so checkout is faster next time. Your password is stored only as a secure one-way hash. You can update your details anytime from your account, or ask us to delete your account by emailing customerservice@nativetunesmedia.com.</li>
      <li>If you choose to receive special offers, we may email you about new designs and discounts. Every offer email lets you unsubscribe.</li>
      <li>If you are logged in, we save your cart to your account so it is there on any device. If you opted in to offer emails and leave items in your cart for a day, we may send you one reminder.</li>
      <li>We don't sell your personal information.</li>
      <li>All Native Tunes designs, artwork, logos and music are owned by Parraga International LLC DBA Native Tunes and Native Tunes Media, and may not be copied or resold.</li>
      <li>Questions? Contact <a href="mailto:customerservice@nativetunesmedia.com">customerservice@nativetunesmedia.com</a>.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: October 27, 2026</p>
  </div></div>
</section>
<section class="page aurora" id="page-disclaimer">
  <div class="wrap sub-hero"><div class="copy"><span class="eyebrow">Legal</span><h1>Disclaimer</h1></div></div>
  <div class="wrap"><div class="prose">
    <p>Native Tunes music and products are for relaxation and enjoyment. They are not medical treatment and are not a substitute for advice from a doctor or mental health professional. Statements about frequencies such as 432 Hz or 528 Hz describe the music and are not health claims.</p>
    <p>Affirmation designs are for inspiration only and don't promise financial, health or other results.</p>
    <p>Native Tunes designs are inspired by music and nature. Our products are not made by Native American artists and are not marketed as Native American made, in keeping with the Indian Arts and Crafts Act.</p>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: October 26, 2026</p>
  </div></div>
</section>
</main>

